DISCLAIMER FOR ACCESSIBILITY USE:
This software is provided as a research prototype to assist visually impaired
users. It MUST NOT be used as a replacement for traditional mobility aids such
as white canes, guide dogs, or sighted assistance. Users acknowledge that the
system may produce inaccurate or hallucinated descriptions of the environment
and use it at their own risk.
